  "title": "The CEO Had Billions but Couldn't Find HAPPINESS… Until His 4-Year-Old Daughter Came HOME!",
  "description": "💔 HE HAD BILLIONS… BUT NOTHING COULD HEAL HIS BROKEN HEART! UNTIL HIS 4-YEAR-OLD DAUGHTER CAME HOME! 👧❤️<br><br>Ethan had everything money could buy.<br><br>A fortune. A beautiful home. A life most people could only dream of.<br><br>But after losing his beloved wife, the wealthy businessman was trapped in grief.<br><br>No amount of money could bring back the happiness he had lost.<br><br>Then, on a stormy night, a little girl named Poppy suddenly entered his life.<br><br>And everything began to change. ❤️<br><br>👧 A 4-YEAR-OLD GIRL APPEARED… AND SHE WAS HIS LONG-LOST DAUGHTER!<br><br>Poppy was only four years old.<br><br>But she had already experienced more heartbreak than any little girl should have to face.<br><br>A mistake in official records had kept her separated from her father for two long years.<br><br>Now, fate had finally brought them back together!<br><br>Ethan had spent so long living with his own pain that he barely knew how to open his heart again.<br><br>And Poppy needed a father who could make her feel safe, loved, and wanted.<br><br>Neither of them knew how much they needed each other.<br><br>💔 HE THOUGHT HE HAD LOST HIS FAMILY… BUT HIS DAUGHTER GAVE HIM A REASON TO SMILE AGAIN!<br><br>At first, Ethan struggled to face the grief he had buried for years.<br><br>He loved his daughter, but learning to become a father while coping with loss was not easy.<br><br>Poppy, with her innocent heart and quiet courage, slowly helped him find his way forward.<br><br>Through small moments of love, trust, and companionship, the two began rebuilding their broken lives.<br><br>And Ethan finally found the courage to seek emotional support and begin healing.<br><br>❤️ THE BILLIONAIRE THOUGHT HE WAS SAVING HIS DAUGHTER… BUT SHE WAS SAVING HIM TOO!<br><br>As Ethan learned to become the father Poppy needed, he also began letting go of the loneliness that had consumed him.<br><br>And with her father&apos;s love and patience, Poppy started finding the comfort and security she had been missing.<br><br>They couldn&apos;t change the past.<br><br>But they could build a new future together.<br><br>Eventually, their journey inspired them to create a welcoming space for other families who needed support, understanding, and a fresh start.<br><br>👑 HE HAD ALL THE MONEY IN THE WORLD… BUT HIS LITTLE GIRL WAS HIS GREATEST TREASURE!<br><br>Can a grieving father learn to smile again?<br><br>Can a little girl finally find the loving home she deserves?<br><br>And can two broken hearts heal each other?<br><br>Watch this emotional family drama about a billionaire father, his long-lost daughter, a heartbreaking reunion, and the extraordinary power of family love!<br><br>✨ DRAMA HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>👧 Little Girl × Billionaire Dad<br><br>💔 Lost Wife × Broken Heart<br><br>🌧️ Stormy Night × Unexpected Reunion<br><br>📁 Records Mix-Up × Two Years Apart<br><br>❤️ Father-Daughter Love × Emotional Healing<br><br>🏡 Lost Family × Second Chance<br><br>💎 Wealthy Father × Priceless Family Love<br><br>🌸 Healing Together × New Beginnings<br><br>💬 LET&apos;S TALK!<br><br>If you could give Ethan one piece of advice about becoming a father again, what would you tell him? ❤️<br><br>And which is more important: having all the money in the world or having someone who truly loves you?<br><br>Share your thoughts in the comments! 💕<br><br>💎 WELCOME TO DAILY DRAMA SHORTS 💎<br><br>Love emotional family dramas, adorable children, billionaire dads, heartfelt reunions, healing stories, and beautiful family bonds?<br><br>You&apos;ve come to the right place!<br><br>🔔 Subscribe to 【DAILY DRAMA SHORTS】 for more touching family stories, emotional dramas, unexpected reunions, and unforgettable moments!<br><br>❤️ LIKE if you&apos;re rooting for Ethan and Poppy!<br><br>💬 COMMENT your favorite heartwarming moment!<br><br>✨ SUBSCRIBE for more incredible dramas!<br><br>⚠️ VIEWER DISCRETION ADVISED<br><br>This video is a fictional drama created for entertainment purposes. It may